flowchart LR
  S0["Receive and retain<br/>Associate checks intake<br/>Keep original and version<br/>Classify access restrictions<br/>Track missing documents"]
  S1["Review the evidence<br/>Apply an approved playbook<br/>AI proposes a candidate<br/>Lawyer checks exact passage<br/>Record corrections and gaps"]
  S0 --> S1
  S2["Draft and approve<br/>Draft from reviewed findings<br/>Keep citations and annexes<br/>Independent report review<br/>Changed draft needs review"]
  S1 --> S2
  S3["Release to an audience<br/>Separate Halden decision<br/>Separate Castlegate decision<br/>Apply antitrust gate if needed<br/>Recheck access on download"]
  S2 --> S3